msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Docs.php:435
msgid "Routes and turn-by-turn steps inside your maps, for driving, walking and cycling; routes planned through a map’s places; GPX elevation profiles."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Docs.php:435
msgid "Settings → Directions; map editor → Places"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Docs.php:436
msgid "Submissions and dealers"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Docs.php:436
msgid "A form for visitors or dealers to add their location, reviewed before it goes live; “My locations” for updates; enquiries routed to the nearest dealer."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Docs.php:436
msgid "Settings → Submissions, Leads to dealers; blocks"
